<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Upcoming Payment Reminder for Your Property in {!relatedTo.ProjectName__c} - {!relatedTo.Unit__r.Name}" recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="SalesOrder__c" >
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
    <html>
   
   
       <body>
       <table style="text-align:justify;width: 100%;">
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                    <img src="cid:cd29873a-204d-46c8-b9b0-34024d35add8" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"/>                                
               </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                      &nbsp;
               </td>
           </tr>  
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   Dear <!--{!relatedTo.Primary_Contact_Title__c} {!relatedTo.PrimaryContact__r.Name}, {!relatedTo.Primary_Contact_Title__c} {!relatedTo.PrimaryContact__r.Name},--> {{ownerName}},
               </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   &nbsp;
               </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   We sincerely appreciate your continued trust and partnership in the Reem Hills development projects.
               </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                  &nbsp;
               </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   As previously communicated, we would like to remind you that the payment originally scheduled for <b>31 December 2024</b> has been revised. The updated due date is now set for <b>31 May 2025</b>.
               </td>
           </tr>
           
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   <br/>To ensure a seamless and timely process and since your original cheque date is expired, we will be depositing applicable Post-Dated Cheque and appropriately allocate it towards <b>Milestone No 5</b> on <b>19 June 2025</b>.
               </td>
           </tr>
           
           <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   <br/>We would also be grateful for your assistance in ensuring that sufficient funds are available in your account to enable successful cheque clearance.
               </td>
           </tr>
           
                      <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
                   <br/>Thank you once again for your understanding and continued cooperation. Should you have any questions or require further clarification, please do not hesitate to get in touch with us.
               </td>
           </tr>
           
           
                            
            <tr>
                <td colspan="2">
                    <br/>For more information and immediate assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us on 800-MODON (66366) or visit our Customer Management on the 20th floor of Al Maryah Tower.<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maryah+Tower/@24.49841,54.3906064,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5e67acdf150f29:0x5f4ca7797b069048!8m2!3d24.49841!4d54.3906064!16s%2Fg%2F11f03pn0pd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDQxNC4xIKXMDSoJLDEwMjExNDUzSAFQAw%3D%3D">Click here for location</a>.
                 </td>
            </tr>  
            <tr>
               <td>
                   <br/>Warm Regards,<br/>Customer Management
               </td>
            </tr>
           
            <br/>
            <tr>
               <td colspan="2">
            <img src="cid:88bb9c75-4a8d-4819-b7a0-12eaa6670860" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"/>
